1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,960
How fast did the winning car go?
获胜的汽车速度有多快？

2
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:16,330
How fast did the winning car go?
获胜的汽车速度有多快？

3
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:23,040
Once a year, a race is held for old cars.
每年都要举行一次旧车比赛。

4
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:27,780
A lot of cars entered for this race last year
去年有很多车参加了这场比赛，

5
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:32,120
and there was a great deal of excitement just before it began.
比赛开始前大家非常兴奋。

6
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:39,230
One of the most handsome cars was a Rolls-Royce Silver Ghost.
最漂亮的汽车之一是一辆罗尔斯·罗伊斯“银鬼”。

7
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:48,680
The most unusual car was a Benz which had only three wheels. Built in 1885,
最不寻常的是一辆只有三个轮子的奔驰车，它造于1885年，

8
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:51,660
it was the oldest car taking part.
是参赛车中最老的一辆。

9
00:00:52,830 --> 00:00:56,180
After a great many loud explosions,
在一阵阵巨大的爆响之后，

10
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,500
the race began.
比赛开始了。

11
00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:04,430
Many of the cars broke down on the course and some drivers spent more time
许多车在途中抛了锚，有些司机

12
00:01:04,450 --> 00:01:06,710
under their cars than in them!
待在车底下的时间比坐在车里的时间还长！

13
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:10,910
A few cars, however, completed the race.
不过有几辆车跑完了全程。

14
00:01:12,190 --> 00:01:19,840
The winning car reached a speed of forty miles an hour--much faster than any of its rivals.
获胜的车时速达到40英里，比任何对手都快得多。

15
00:01:21,030 --> 00:01:28,060
It sped downhill at the end of the race and its driver had a lot of trouble trying to stop it.
比赛结束时它冲下山坡，司机费了很大劲才把车停下。

16
00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:32,110
The race gave everyone a great deal of pleasure.
这场比赛给大家带来了极大的乐趣。

17
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:38,050
It was very different from modern car races but no less exciting.
它与现代汽车比赛大不相同，但同样激动人心。
